'''Poliwag''' (Japanese: '''ニョロモ''' ''Nyoromo'') is a {{ct|Water}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Promo-A}} series of cards.

